BT /F1 12 Tf 14.4 TL ET
BT 1 0 0 1 72 700 Tm (We walked the north trail just after sunrise. The first marker was) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 72 676 Tm (hidden by tall grass. We cleared the path and) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 72 652 Tm (recorded its position.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 88 628 Tm (The second marker stood beside a shallow creek. We took a bearing) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 72 604 Tm (from the bridge and checked it against the map.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 72 564 Tm (The return route passed through a stand of birch trees.) Tj T* ET
 

